[
  {
    "timestamp": "00:00:11,184 --> 00:00:13,648",
    "chinese": "腾飞，你最喜欢什么故事？",
    "english": "What’s your favourite story, Teng Fei?"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "00:00:14,176 --> 00:00:16,432",
    "chinese": "哦，我喜欢这个故事。",
    "english": "Oh, I like this one."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "00:00:17,056 --> 00:00:18,976",
    "chinese": "一个农夫丢了他的马。",
    "english": "A farmer lost his horse."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "00:00:19,184 --> 00:00:21,488",
    "chinese": "他的邻居们说：“真倒霉！”",
    "english": "His neighbours said, “How unlucky!”"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "00:00:21,888 --> 00:00:24,480",
    "chinese": "但农夫只是说：“未必。”",
    "english": "But the farmer just said, “Maybe.”"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "00:00:25,296 --> 00:00:29,296",
    "chinese": "后来，他的马带着另外七匹马回来了。",
    "english": "Later, his horse came back with seven other horses."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "00:00:29,712 --> 00:00:34,784",
    "chinese": "人们说：“太好了！”但农夫说：“未必。”",
    "english": "People said, “That’s great!” But the farmer said, “Maybe.”"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "00:00:35,312 --> 00:00:37,552",
    "chinese": "后来，他的儿子在尝试骑马时",
    "english": "Later, his son broke his leg"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "00:00:37,664 --> 00:00:39,376",
    "chinese": "摔断了腿。",
    "english": "when he tried to ride a horse."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "00:00:39,776 --> 00:00:43,312",
    "chinese": "人们说：“太糟糕了！”又一次，",
    "english": "People said, “That’s terrible!” Again,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "00:00:43,744 --> 00:00:46,016",
    "chinese": "农夫说：“未必。”",
    "english": "the farmer said, “Maybe.”"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "00:00:46,608 --> 00:00:51,248",
    "chinese": "结果，正因为他的腿受伤了，儿子才不必参军打仗。",
    "english": "Well, because of his leg, the son didn’t have to join a war."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "00:00:51,856 --> 00:00:53,136",
    "chinese": "这救了他的命！",
    "english": "That saved his life!"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "00:00:53,648 --> 00:00:57,648",
    "chinese": "我明白了。不幸的事情也可能带来好的结果。",
    "english": "I see. Unlucky things may turn out well."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "00:00:58,064 --> 00:01:00,864",
    "chinese": "而好的事情也可能变糟。",
    "english": "And good things could go wrong too."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "00:01:01,184 --> 00:01:03,280",
    "chinese": "是的，世事难料。",
    "english": "Yes, you never know."
  }
]